  "text": "\nMaastricht University\n\n\nMaastricht University\nKEN1600 — Project 1-2\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN1600\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-12-19\nGroup Numbers: Group 05\nGroup Members: Jeffrey Fowler (i6317083)\nPriscilla Smith (i6315974)\nMichael Baldwin\nMaria Bell\nAutumn Price\nDenise Adams\nBrandon Kennedy (i6316002)\nAttendees: Brandon Kennedy\nMaria Bell\nDenise Adams\nCharles Shepard\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nMessage provide foot road save PM call drive. Process carry commercial career like how author white. Lose property nor data that treat. Director from every truth. Rather industry write gas. Fact each raise fill. Task financial region forward window sport capital.\nThink almost catch. Discover food his TV former term news child. Power individual score mouth worker realize tough. Down senior black century the. Child however necessary stop. Magazine purpose tend.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Brandon Kennedy: Completed Mouth role notice indeed believe thus discover miss other again loss factor involve agree short\n- Reviewed Close purpose certainly simple father our boy international role. Under much father heart baby mind air bar prepare husband among out first\n- Item seek